= Nicole Gohlke

Nicole Gohlke is an education and migration activist and a founder of the Bewegungslinke.

Fame: [+ gohlke_advisor_fame +]

- @campaign_youth
- @radicalize_foreign
- @education
- @root: Return to main

@campaign_youth
title: Campaign among young people
subtitle: The future lies with them.
choose-if: advisor_action_timer <= 0
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?]
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; youth_linke += 0.8*(gohlke_advisor_fame/100); gohlke_advisor_fame += 2; social_moderation -= 0.2; oldleft_dissent += 0.6 if oldleft_leader = "Wagenknecht"; oldleft_dissent += 0.6 if oldleft_leader = "Pellmann"; pragmatist_dissent += 0.4;

We have campaigned among young people. They bring new members, but also new views, which some people in our party dislike.

@radicalize_foreign
title: Assert pacifist stance
subtitle: We must fight against all wars and militarism.
choose-if: advisor_action_timer <= 0
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?]
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; foreign_moderation -= 0.5*(gohlke_advisor_fame/100); gohlke_advisor_fame += 2; pragmatist_dissent += 2; issue_antimilitarism += 0.2*(gohlke_advisor_fame/100); greens_relation -= 3; spd_relation -= 2;

We have asserted a more strongly pacifist stance. Our right wing, however, disapproves, and the moderate parties have also been made wary by this action.

